ータが格納されている順番を意識して読み取り命令を出せばよいのか","ts":"1628093035.116500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KMH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b754c022-8a6c-4046-8995-a3a652b3ca40","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー","ts":"1628092998.115900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UNf4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"191f5bb9-dfb5-40e8-bb83-f66a9332d1b0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1628092966.115300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nPFQG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a70758ea-aec9-4092-9b6a-7d1d73992ee0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"CPUはそこまでfuzzyな判断はできないです、機械的に命令を解釈して実行するだけ","ts":"1628092963.115100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZHOZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2ad29d9-3037-45f1-8eb7-af19b3f0ea2c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これ、CPUが判断するわけじゃなく、人間やコンパイラが1バイト読み取るという命令を与えたから、ですね","ts":"1628092945.114500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ougM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7825b6a-f768-4c5d-9921-b1794651aa76","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"んー、うまく言葉にできない…","ts":"1628092886.113600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9MNEE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4790e877-c93a-489b-9dac-654d2beed830","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ワカラナイのがCPUはどうやって、1バイトだけ読み取ってデータがあるからもうこれ以上読み取らんでOKって判断しているのか","ts":"1628092874.113200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qRLUC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41968193-a7c7-4202-bb1f-46c63bca2d49","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー、そうか、そうだ","ts":"1628092791.112000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FWZQ2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6022bd22-bc92-40aa-9b02-d5b0891a6d91","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あー、ちょっと説明違うな\n0x00 0x00 0x00 0x01\nbig だと4バイト読み取らないといけないけど\nlittleだと↓の順番になるから、1バイトだけ読み取ればOK、が正しいすね\n0x01 0x00 0x00 0x00","ts":"1628092769.111800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TZnX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3f253e0-a282-4028-870c-fcf13630f609","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"完全に言ってること汲み取れてるかは分からないけど、big endianの欠点に関してはそう","ts":"1628092662.110400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aVSJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7581dc3-d6bb-404c-b809-2ca4113ffa3d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ですね","ts":"1628092601.109600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kunu7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"036d36b6-22e4-4214-8696-107ac0108dab","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"1バイトのデータを４バイトでアライメントされている状態を↓とすると\n0x00 0x00 0x00 0x01\nlittle endianで読み取ると一番右の 0x01 を読み取れば終わり\n対して big endian だと4バイト全部読み取らないと0x01 のデータを読み取れない\n的な話しと解釈しています","ts":"1628092572.109400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DuMPb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9748608e-2d47-4e0c-b72e-05d29482098a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/pokemium/status/1422941343014260737?s=20\u003e\nなんとなく言いたいことがわかったような","ts":"1628092401.107200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/pokemium|@pokemium\u003e: \u003chttps://twitter.com/__syumai|@__syumai\u003e \u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513|@gorilla0513\u003e リトルエンディアンだと2や4バイト単位でアラインメントされてる1バイトデータにバイト単位のアクセスでもデータが読み出せるってメリットがあります","id":1,"author_name":"アカツキ","author_subname":"@pokemium","author_link":"https://twitter.com/pokemium/status/1422941343014260737","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1194430120859070464/JPrgzPr1_normal.jpg","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/__syumai|@__syumai\u003e \u003chttps://twitter.com/gorilla0513|@gorilla0513\u003e リトルエンディアンだと2や4バイト単位でアラインメントされてる1バイトデータにバイト単位のアクセスでもデータが読み出せるってメリットがあります","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1628090627,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/pokemium/status/1422941343014260737?s=20","original_url":"https://twitter.com/pokemium/status/1422941343014260737?s=20"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vE2L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49f82d72-dca4-43b9-bff8-a3650b40fb97","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"現実には間にキャッシュが挟まってたりするけど命令レベルではこの解釈でいいはず","ts":"1628092332.106600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hhuR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8297a2ce-4005-4e97-b931-daa4a3132fa7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"CPU内部には容量が非常に小さい代わりに超高速なレジスタと呼ばれるメモリ領域があって、特定の命令(x86ではmovと呼ばれている)を解釈するとメモリとレジスタ間でデータをやり取りする、みたいな説明でいいんだろうか","ts":"1628092234.106100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fcR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ccdc49b-52d2-4402-a5a8-60b1a9704d9a","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"\u003chttps://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4839909865/\u003e 回路まで遡るんだったら、これがおすすめ","ts":"1628092089.105300","attachments":[{"fallback":"CPUの創りかた","id":1,"title":"CPUの創りかた","title_link":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4839909865/","text":"CPUの創りかた","image_url":"https://images-fe.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/51ATDABNHEL._SR600%2c315_PIWhiteStrip%2cBottomLeft%2c0%2c35_PIStarRatingFOURANDHALF%2cBottomLeft%2c360%2c-6_SR600%2c315_ZA194%2c445%2c290%2c400%2c400%2cAmazonEmberBold%2c12%2c4%2c0%2c0%2c5_SCLZZZZZZZ_FMpng_BG255%2c255%2c255.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"amazon.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4839909865/","original_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4839909865/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4nQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8d6f8e7-30e5-4ae3-8dfa-6fc27ca76f69","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"CPUがどのようにメモリを読み取るのかがワカラナイ、ということがわかったので、まずそこを理解するところから…","ts":"1628091463.103200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"06d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7f1f4be-9b9b-4f46-a9a0-516c9f6253a8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"union","ts":"1628091189.102700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6QDX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb82ef9d-6158-4f01-afb8-a394c410e83d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"リトルエンディアンだとCPU内部でintの値をshortとして解釈するみたいなのが楽にできるという話を聞いた","ts":"1628091135.102500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X8MCu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6796853a-935f-45b6-882d-c73cb37aa1ea","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"私もググってたのでぺたり\n\u003chttps://news.mynavi.jp/article/architecture-118/\u003e","ts":"1628090794.101800","attachments":[{"fallback":"TECH+: コンピュータアーキテクチャの話(118) データタイプとアライメント(2)","id":1,"title":"コンピュータアーキテクチャの話(118) データタイプとアライメント(2)","title_link":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/architecture-118/","text":"バイト単位のメモリアクセスをサポートするコンピュータでは、アドレスの最小単位はバイトとなる。アクセス対象が1バイトの場合は問題ないが、2バイト以上の場合は、整数として最上位のバイトを最初のアドレスに格納する方式と、この逆に最下位のバイトを最初のアドレスに格納する方式があり得る。","image_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/assets/common/logo_ogp-f44b720a365aa20669d9aaed97d5885986aa7c8a16d71dc16c758ac1e4fef112.png","blocks":null,"ts":1210509709,"service_name":"TECH+","service_icon":"https://news.mynavi.jp/images/techplus/favicon_techplus.ico","from_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/architecture-118/","original_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/architecture-118/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qFvb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5f6cee0-1809-4440-994a-b77c90a75df5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://softwareengineering.stackexchange.com/questions/95556/what-is-the-advantage-of-little-endian-format\u003e\nとりあえずlittle endianのメリットは、多分わかった","ts":"1628090761.101400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Software Engineering Stack Exchange: What is the advantage of little endian format?","id":1,"title":"What is the advantage of little endian format?","title_link":"https://softwareengineering.stackexchange.com/questions/95556/what-is-the-advantage-of-little-endian-format","text":"Intel processors (and maybe some others) use the little endian format for storage. I always wonder why someone would want to store the bytes in reverse order. Does this format have any advantages...","thumb_url":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/softwareengineering/Img/apple-touch-icon@2.png?v=1ef7363febba","blocks":null,"service_name":"Software Engineering Stack Exchange","service_icon":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/softwareengineering/Img/apple-touch-icon.png?v=5e581fc45e58","thumb_width":316,"thumb_height":316,"from_url":"https://softwareengineering.stackexchange.com/questions/95556/what-is-the-advantage-of-little-endian-format","original_url":"https://softwareengineering.stackexchange.com/questions/95556/what-is-the-advantage-of-little-endian-format"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DqD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65e97431-1ca1-44da-830a-655feb57e2db","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"結局データって、決まった規則で入っていて、規則通りに読み込む(解釈する)しかないんですよね","ts":"1628090502.101100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vr9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be05dd50-d48c-425b-bd57-8ab1cccc8b59","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"バイエンディアンもあるらしく、何でもありかよって気持ちになってきた","ts":"1628090464.100500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"joUQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0886aef3-7918-4de4-a47b-4e223f661eff","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"みたいですね","ts":"1628090445.099900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=7wb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c349e081-142b-41da-800a-4949c2ec9da9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ミドルエンディアンは普通は使わないので忘れてよいかとw","ts":"1628090430.099600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2qg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82e5e94e-90f0-4a90-93ac-b91972f099a6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そういうもんとしか言いようがないやつ","ts":"1628090391.099200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+E0l"}]}]
